<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="section section-dark" style="padding-top: 140px;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
    <span class="kicker">ABOUT THE PLATFORM</span>
    <h1 style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Democratizing Clear Guidance for Indian Government Aspirants</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 48px; line-height: 1.8;">
      The Dreams was founded to bridge the gap between student ambition and structured guidance. Millions of candidates appear for SSC, Banking, Railways, UPSC, and State Police exams every year, yet most struggle to find clean, verified facts about eligibility, syllabus, and book selections.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-secondary">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="kicker">OUR EVOLUTION</span>
      <h2>The Problem, The Idea & The Platform</h2>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 32px;">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="badge" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">STAGE 1</span>
        <h3>The Information Gap</h3>
        <p>10th and 12th pass students frequently waste weeks reading clickbait websites or watching hours of YouTube videos just to learn basic exam patterns and eligibility rules.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="badge" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">STAGE 2</span>
        <h3>The Architectural Vision</h3>
        <p>Designed a database-driven system that maps every exam to its exact prep level, stage pattern, subject list, and recommended books without external dependencies.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="badge" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">STAGE 3</span>
        <h3>The Dreams Launch</h3>
        <p>A fast, elegant, monochromatic portal that puts student clarity first, supported by intelligent search filtering, rule-based chatbot assistance, and admin management.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-dark">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="kicker">CORE VALUES</span>
      <h2>What Drives Every Line of Code</h2>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;">
      <div class="card" style="display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--color-accent);">01</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Absolute Clarity</h3>
          <p>We present facts directly — qualifications, stage counts, official links, and books — with zero clickbait.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--color-accent);">02</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Monochromatic Quiet Confidence</h3>
          <p>Design is focused on reading comfort and high legibility so students can concentrate on study paths.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--color-accent);">03</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Engineering Integrity</h3>
          <p>Built with Node.js, Express, Prisma ORM, and SQLite — engineered to scale modularly as new feature modules are added.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
